```

冒泡排序（单重循环）：
```python
i = 0
while i < n:
    swapped = False
    for j in range(0, n - i - 1):
        if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:
            arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]
            swapped = True
    if not swapped:
        break
    i += 1
```

